@CatalogApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101
@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8180

### Start the AppHost first. Reads are public. Saving a book needs the token of an admin, so run the login first.

### Login of admin (password: admin) => OK, with the access token for the requests below
# @name admin
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/cat-demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=cat-demo-cli&username=admin&password=admin


### Run the requests from top to bottom. Later requests use ids from earlier responses.
### The database is seeded in Development with 4 categories and 7 books.

### CategoryGetListRequest => OK (4 categories)
# @name categories
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/categories

### BookSearchRequest => OK (all books, sorted by title)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books

### BookSearchRequest => OK (title, author or ISBN contains the text)
# @name search
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books?text=clean

### BookSearchRequest => OK (books of the first category)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books?categoryId={{categories.response.body.$[0].id}}

### BookSearchRequest => OK (text and category together)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books?text=history&categoryId={{categories.response.body.$[2].id}}

### BookGetRequest => OK (the first book of the search above)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/{{search.response.body.$[0].id}}

### BookGetRequest => Not Found (CAT-GEN-1002)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### BookGetRequest => Route does not match the guid constraint, so 404
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/abc

### BookSaveRequest => OK (no id, so a new book is added)
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780596007126",
  "categoryId": "{{categories.response.body.$[3].id}}",
  "title": "Head First Design Patterns",
  "author": "Eric Freeman",
  "price": 44.50
}

### BookSaveRequest => OK (the id of an existing book, so it is updated)
### The old price moves to the History.BookPrice table.
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{search.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "isbn": "{{search.response.body.$[0].isbn}}",
  "categoryId": "{{search.response.body.$[0].categoryId}}",
  "title": "{{search.response.body.$[0].title}}",
  "author": "{{search.response.body.$[0].author}}",
  "price": 29.95
}

### BookSaveRequest => OK (no price, so the current price stays)
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{search.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "isbn": "{{search.response.body.$[0].isbn}}",
  "categoryId": "{{search.response.body.$[0].categoryId}}",
  "title": "{{search.response.body.$[0].title}}",
  "author": "{{search.response.body.$[0].author}}"
}

### BookSaveRequest => Bad request, the ISBN is already used by another book (DEM-CTL-1000)
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780141036144",
  "categoryId": "{{categories.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "title": "Another 1984",
  "author": "George Orwell",
  "price": 9.99
}

### BookSaveRequest => Bad request, several rules fail (ISBN length, title, author, category, price)
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "123",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "price": -1
}

### BookSaveRequest => Bad request, the book is missing from the body
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### BookSaveRequest => Bad request, the body is not valid json
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{bad json

### BookSaveRequest => Unsupported media type
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### BookPriceListRequest => OK (the current price of the first two books of the search above)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/prices?bookIds={{search.response.body.$[0].id}}&bookIds={{search.response.body.$[1].id}}

### BookPriceListRequest => Not Found, the book does not exist or has no price (DEM-CTL-1001)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/prices?bookIds=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### BookPriceListRequest => Bad request, no book ids
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/catalog/books/prices
